\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/unit/grounding/test_conformance.py:1-22, 88-95, 127-132, 351-353, 374-378, 414-416` — Preserve the backend/failure matrix and worker-isolation invariant. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/grounding/test_coverage_reconstruction.py:1-17, 99-100, 134-135` — Preserve complete per-backend coverage accounting. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/grounding/test_engine_b.py:1-16, 149-150, 189-191, 212-213, 434-437, 475-477` — Preserve quarantine, routing, deduplication, and validation behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/grounding/test_environment_resolution.py:1-21` — Preserve environment lookup, confirm-only behavior, and optional-dependency skips. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/grounding/test_harness.py:143-147, 302-313` — Preserve interrupt propagation and poll-based crash-versus-timeout classification. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/grounding/test_non_adoption.py:1-17, 48-50, 59-60, 83-84, 112-123, 145-146` — Preserve the optionality and fail-open guarantees, stated once. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/grounding/test_polyglot_corpus.py:1-21, 120-124, 209-210, 223-224, 236-237, 258-261` — Preserve collision, member, language, workspace, alias, and stdlib guard scenarios. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/grounding/test_resolve.py:1-16, 181-187` — Preserve the guarded-versus-naive discriminator and optional-tool behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/grounding/test_yield_eval.py:1-20, 42-44, 49-55` — Preserve independent corpus selection, measured yield floor, and zero-false-refute control. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/grounding/test_conformance.py tests/unit/grounding/test_coverage_reconstruction.py tests/unit/grounding/test_engine_b.py tests/unit/grounding/test_environment_resolution.py tests/unit/grounding/test_harness.py tests/unit/grounding/test_non_adoption.py tests/unit/grounding/test_polyglot_corpus.py tests/unit/grounding/test_resolve.py tests/unit/grounding/test_yield_eval.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/unit/grounding/test_conformance.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/grounding/test_coverage_reconstruction.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/grounding/test_engine_b.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/grounding/test_environment_resolution.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/grounding/test_harness.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/grounding/test_non_adoption.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstr